diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index ea1a1a0..9a52a1b 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,23 @@ Semantic Versioning.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- **Breaking:** `v1.Files.Add` now takes a file name and a content reader —
+  `Add(ctx, fileName, content, opts...)` — and encodes the
+  `multipart/form-data` body itself, matching `v1.CallLogs.AddRecording` and
+  the v2 product-image upload. Callers that hand-built the multipart body now
+  pass just the file name and content; `Raw().Do` remains the escape hatch
+  for full control over the payload.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Uploads via `v1.Files.Add` are now retried on 429/5xx like every other
+  call. The previous raw-reader signature produced requests without a
+  replayable body, which the retry transport (correctly) refused to replay,
+  so rate-limited uploads failed on the first attempt even with
+  `RetryPolicy{RetryAllMethods: true}`.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
